{"id": "short-bn-0000", "lang": "bn", "category": "short", "text": "পাকিস্তান জিন্দাবাদ", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC-BY-2.0-FR"}
{"id": "short-bn-0001", "lang": "bn", "category": "short", "text": "পাকিস্তান দীর্ঘজীবি হোক", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC-BY-2.0-FR"}
{"id": "short-bn-0002", "lang": "bn", "category": "short", "text": "ঠিক আছে!", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC-BY-2.0-FR"}
{"id": "short-bn-0003", "lang": "bn", "category": "short", "text": "আমি দ্রাবিড় ভাষাগুলি পছন্দ করি।", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC-BY-2.0-FR"}
{"id": "short-bn-0004", "lang": "bn", "category": "short", "text": "তুমি কী খাবে?", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC-BY-2.0-FR"}
{"id": "short-bn-0005", "lang": "bn", "category": "short", "text": "তুই কী খাবি?", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC-BY-2.0-FR"}
{"id": "short-bn-0006", "lang": "bn", "category": "short", "text": "এটা উজ্জ্বল ছিল।", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC-BY-2.0-FR"}
{"id": "short-bn-0007", "lang": "bn", "category": "short", "text": "আমি স্কুলে যেতে চাই না।", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC-BY-2.0-FR"}
{"id": "short-bn-0008", "lang": "bn", "category": "short", "text": "আমি ইংরেজি শিখতে চেষ্টা করছি।", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC-BY-2.0-FR"}
{"id": "short-bn-0009", "lang": "bn", "category": "short", "text": "সান্টা ক্লজ উত্তর মেরুতে থাকেন।", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC-BY-2.0-FR"}
{"id": "short-bn-0010", "lang": "bn", "category": "short", "text": "আমার ফোন নাম্বার হলো ৭৮৯।", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC-BY-2.0-FR"}
{"id": "short-bn-0011", "lang": "bn", "category": "short", "text": "এই হলো আমার ফোন নাম্বার।", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC-BY-2.0-FR"}
{"id": "short-bn-0012", "lang": "bn", "category": "short", "text": "টম বাড়িতে নেই।", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC-BY-2.0-FR"}
{"id": "short-bn-0013", "lang": "bn", "category": "short", "text": "টম চূড়ান্তভাবে অপদস্ত হলো।", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC-BY-2.0-FR"}
{"id": "short-bn-0014", "lang": "bn", "category": "short", "text": "পানিই জীবন।", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC-BY-2.0-FR"}
{"id": "short-bn-0015", "lang": "bn", "category": "short", "text": "ইয়ানি তার মাছের সাথে কথা বলেছিল।", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC-BY-2.0-FR"}
{"id": "short-bn-0016", "lang": "bn", "category": "short", "text": "তোমাদের টমকে সাহায্য করতে হবে।", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC-BY-2.0-FR"}
{"id": "short-bn-0017", "lang": "bn", "category": "short", "text": "আমি টমকে কখনও পাই নি।", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC-BY-2.0-FR"}
{"id": "short-bn-0018", "lang": "bn", "category": "short", "text": "আমি তোমাকে এখানে একা ছেড়ে যাবো না।", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC-BY-2.0-FR"}
{"id": "short-bn-0019", "lang": "bn", "category": "short", "text": "টম ম্যারিকে গিটার বাজাতে বলেছে।", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC-BY-2.0-FR"}
